from build_foundations import *
p=Paper('F01')
base=[(r'有限总体$N$、$n=|N|\ge2$、不同$i,j\in N$、$0\le m\le n-2$；对大小为m的合法上下文取均匀平均。固定输入与输入基线，$g(S)=v(x_S)$，$b=g(\varnothing)$，$g_0=g-b$。',r'A finite universe $N$ has $n\ge2$, with distinct $i,j\in N$ and $0\le m\le n-2$. Average uniformly over admissible contexts of size m. Fix the input and input baseline, and write $g(S)=v(x_S)$, $b=g(\varnothing)$ and $g_0=g-b$.')]
i1=p.issue('robustness-entropy-proof-sign','Proposition1原证明的两处熵符号错误','Two entropy-sign errors in the proof of Proposition 1','proof_error',r'v(S)=+H(Y\mid X_S)\quad\text{but proof substitutes }-H','supplement PDF6 B.4 proof of Eq.(6)',r'原命题定义+H。正确四项差为$H(Y\mid S,i,j)-H(Y\mid S,i)-H(Y\mid S,j)+H(Y\mid S)$，等于$MI(X_i;Y\mid S)-MI(X_i;Y\mid S,X_j)$。原证明用了四项的相反数，再用了与Eq7相反的三元MI定义，最终两错抵消。H(H|XS)另为Y误植。',r'The statement uses +H. Its four-term difference equals $MI(X_i;Y\mid S)-MI(X_i;Y\mid S,X_j)$. The proof first negates this difference, then uses the opposite sign convention from Equation (7) for three-way information. The two errors cancel in the final formula. H(H|XS) is also a Y transcription typo.','只修证明；保留原+H与Eq6。原Eq7采用co-information符号，不能改成enhancement约定。','Repair only the proof, retaining +H and Equation (6). Equation (7) uses the co-information convention and is not silently changed to the enhancement convention.',['robustness-entropy-interaction'])
i2=p.issue('robustness-symmetry-context-typo','B.1对称性证明上下文集合误植','Context-set typo in the interaction symmetry proof','proof_error',r'E_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\}}\Delta v(i,k,S)','supplement PDF3 B.1 symmetry first/last expectation',r'对象$I_{ik}^{(m)}$的上下文应排除i,k，首/末平均却印成排除i,j。中间求和实际用N\{i,k}及N\{i,j,k}，可修为交换i,j的上下文双射证明。',r'The contexts of $I_{ik}^{(m)}$ exclude i and k, while the first/last averages print i and j. The intervening sums use the correct exclusions. A context bijection swapping i and j repairs the proof.','对称性原陈述与原条件保持。','The symmetry claim and its premises are preserved.',['robustness-interaction-symmetry'])
i3=p.issue('robustness-dropout-floor','Eq14/15把固定大小取整丢弃率换成连续比例','Equations (14)–(15) replace the rounded fixed-size rate','false_statement_clause',r'k=\lfloor(1-\alpha)n\rfloor\quad\text{but coefficient }1-\alpha','supplement PDF9 H definition; PDF10 Eqs.(14)–(15)',r'原K均匀取固定大小k，不是Bernoulli dropout。取n=4、α=2/5、k=2、$g(S)=|S|$，所有pair交互0，真实均值2，原Eq14为$(1-α)4=12/5$。正确抽取包含率k/n仅可作为另一个修订推导，不能把它冒充原Eq14证明。',r'The source samples a fixed-size subset uniformly, rather than using Bernoulli dropout. For n=4, α=2/5, k=2 and $g(S)=|S|$, all pair interactions vanish and the true mean is 2, whereas Equation (14) gives 12/5. The inclusion probability k/n belongs to a separate corrected derivation and does not prove the original equation.','固定大小平均的floor子句错误；高阶截断及经验cutout结论另分范围。','The rounded-rate clause is false; high-order truncation and empirical cutout conclusions have separate scopes.',['robustness-dropout-expansion'])
i4=p.issue('robustness-disentanglement-zero','D(m)在全零交互上下文未定义','D(m) is undefined for zero interaction contexts','domain_issue',r'\frac{|E\Delta g|}{E|\Delta g|}','formal PDF8 Eq.(4); supplement PDF8 Eq.(10)',r'若全部上下文Δg=0，分母与分子均0，原文未给0/0约定。比值界和同号等号只在分母正的定义域证明；不增加前提后声称全部原定义有效。',r'When all context differences vanish, both numerator and denominator are zero and the source gives no 0/0 convention. Ratio bounds and the same-sign equality apply only on the positive-denominator domain and do not make the original definition total.','单列定义域问题，不等于interaction性质错误。','This is a domain issue, separate from the interaction properties.',['robustness-disentanglement'])
def add(id,zh,en,label,tex,refs,steps,**kw):return p.result(id,zh,en,label,tex,refs,steps,assumptions=base,**kw)
add('robustness-multiorder-definitions','多阶交互与多阶归因定义','Definitions of multi-order interaction and attribution','formal Eq.(2); supplement Eqs.(3)–(5)',r'I_{ij}^{(m)}=\binom{n-2}m^{-1}\sum_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\},|S|=m}\Delta g(i,j,S),\quad\phi^{(m)}(i)=\binom{n-1}m^{-1}\sum_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},|S|=m}(g(S\cup\{i\})-g(S))',[('formal',[4,5,8],'3;4.3'),('supplement',[2,4],'B.1–B.2')],[(r'pair上下文差是四个掩码输出，$\Delta g=g(Sij)-g(Si)-g(Sj)+g(S)$。这里m是上下文大小，不是Harsanyi dividend的集合阶数；n−2才是最大pair上下文。',r'The pair context difference uses four masked outputs: $\Delta g=g(Sij)-g(Si)-g(Sj)+g(S)$. Here m is context size, not the order of a Harsanyi dividend, and n−2 is the largest pair context size.',r'\Delta g(i,j,S)=g(Sij)-g(Si)-g(Sj)+g(S)',['Harsanyi.Robustness.pairDelta']),(r'各掩码输出共享同一基线。常数项在差分抵消，所以非零b不改变pair交互和归因差；空集值仍作为重构基线保留。','All masked outputs share the same baseline. Constants cancel in each difference, so a nonzero output baseline does not change pair interactions or attribution differences; the empty output is retained in reconstruction.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_baseline'])],kind='definition',role='scope_analysis')
props=[
('robustness-interaction-linearity','交互线性','Interaction linearity','B.1 property(1)',r'I_{ij,u}^{(m)}=I_{ij,g}^{(m)}+I_{ij,h}^{(m)}',[2],[(r'逐项展开u=g+h的四个输出并分组为Δg+Δh。合法上下文族和归一化因子对三个游戏相同。','Expand the four outputs for u=g+h and group them as Δg+Δh. The admissible context family and normalizing factor are the same for all three games.',r'\Delta(g+h)=\Delta g+\Delta h',['Harsanyi.Robustness.pairDelta_add']),(r'有限求和分配律把平均拆开，得到原等式。相同方法还给实数倍齐次性，不需要零基线。','Distribute the finite sum to split the averages. The same argument proves real-scalar homogeneity, with no zero-baseline premise.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_linearity'])],['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_linearity'],[]),
('robustness-interaction-nullity','dummy变量的交互为零','Zero interaction for a dummy variable','B.1 property(2)',r'I_{ij}^{(m)}=0',[3],[(r'原dummy假设对每个不含i的上下文R给$g(Ri)=g(R)+g(\{i\})$。分别取R=S和R=Sj，因i,j不同且S排除两者，这两个实例都合法。',r'The original dummy premise gives $g(Ri)=g(R)+g(\{i\})$ for contexts excluding i. Instantiate it at R=S and R=Sj; both are admissible because the players are distinct and S excludes them.',r'\Delta g=[g(Sj)+g(i)]-[g(S)+g(i)]-g(Sj)+g(S)=0'),(r'每项为0所以平均0。原dummy写法在S=∅还推出b=0；项目不把一般游戏b默认为0，只有这个特殊原假设产生零基线。','Every summand is zero, hence so is the average. At S=∅ the source dummy convention itself forces b=0; this is a consequence of that special premise, not a convention for arbitrary games.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_dummy'])],['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_dummy'],[]),
('robustness-interaction-commutativity','pair交互交换律','Pair interaction commutativity','B.1 property(3)',r'I_{ij}^{(m)}=I_{ji}^{(m)}',[3],[(r'交换i,j不改变上下文族；Sij=Sji，两中间项只交换位置，故每个Δg相等。','Swapping i and j leaves the context family fixed. Sij=Sji and the two middle terms merely exchange positions, so every context difference agrees.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.pairDelta_comm']),(r'逐项相等的有限平均相等。','Finite averages of termwise equal quantities are equal.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_commutativity'])],['Harsanyi.Robustness.interaction_commutativity'],[]),
('robustness-interaction-symmetry','合作对称变量的交互相等','Equal interactions for cooperation-symmetric players','B.1 property(4)',r'I_{ik}^{(m)}=I_{jk}^{(m)}',[3],[(r'固定不同i,j,k。将N\{i,k}的m上下文S映为交换i,j后的S′：j∉S则不变；j∈S则用i替换j。此映射自逆、保大小，目标上下文排除j,k。','Fix distinct i,j,k. Map an m-context excluding i,k by swapping i and j: it stays fixed when j is absent, and replaces j by i when present. The map is an involution, preserves size, and reaches exactly the contexts excluding j,k.',''),(r'若S不含j，原合作对称假设在S及Sk给g(Si)=g(Sj)、g(Sik)=g(Sjk)，故Δ(i,k,S)=Δ(j,k,S)。若S=Rj，R排除i,j,k，对R与Rk用原假设，比较四项得到Δ(i,k,Rj)=Δ(j,k,Ri)。','If j is absent, apply the source symmetry premise at S and Sk to match the two differences. If S=Rj, apply it at R and Rk; the four terms give Δ(i,k,Rj)=Δ(j,k,Ri). No stronger game symmetry is assumed.',''),(r'通过保大小双射重排求和，归一化相同即得平均相等。原证明期望集合误植单列修正。','Reindex the sum through this size-preserving bijection. Equal normalization gives the desired equality. The source context-set typo is flagged separately.','')],[],[i2]),
('robustness-shapley-linearity','多阶归因线性','Multi-order attribution linearity','B.2 property(1)',r'\phi_{g+h}^{(m)}(i)=\phi_g^{(m)}(i)+\phi_h^{(m)}(i)',[4],[(r'展开u(Si)−u(S)，分为g与h两个边际项；同一上下文族的有限平均线性。','Expand u(Si)−u(S) as the two marginal contributions for g and h. Finite averaging on the same context family is linear.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_linearity'])],['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_linearity'],[]),
('robustness-shapley-nullity','dummy变量的多阶归因','Multi-order attribution of a dummy player','B.2 property(2)',r'\phi^{(m)}(i)=g(\{i\})',[4],[(r'原dummy假设使每个合法上下文边际g(Si)−g(S)=g({i})。m∈[0,n−1]保证上下文族非空，平均常数等于该常数。','The source dummy premise makes every admissible marginal equal g({i}). The range m∈[0,n−1] makes the context family nonempty, so its average equals that constant.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_dummy']),(r'原假设在S=∅强制b=0，所以此处g({i})亦等于g({i})−b；不能将这个特殊结论推广为一般原输出基线约定。','At S=∅ the source premise forces b=0, so g({i}) also equals g({i})−b here. This special conclusion is not promoted to a general baseline convention.','')],['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_dummy'],[]),
('robustness-shapley-symmetry','合作对称变量的多阶归因相等','Equal multi-order attributions for symmetric players','B.2 property(3)',r'\phi^{(m)}(i)=\phi^{(m)}(j)',[4,5],[(r'将排除i的上下文按是否含j分成两类。未含j的S对应自己，原假设给g(Si)=g(Sj)，边际相同。含j的Rj对应Ri，联合Rij相同，原假设给g(Rj)=g(Ri)，边际亦相同。','Partition contexts excluding i by whether they contain j. A context without j maps to itself and the source premise matches g(Si) and g(Sj). A context Rj maps to Ri; the common combined set Rij and the matched g(Rj),g(Ri) again give equal marginals.',''),(r'该交换是保大小双射，两族均有binom(n−1,m)个上下文；因此均匀平均相等，m=0及m=n−1同样有效。','The swap is a size-preserving bijection, and both families have binom(n−1,m) contexts. Thus the uniform averages agree, including the endpoint orders.','')],[],[])]
for id,z,e,label,tex,pg,steps,ln,iss in props:add(id,z,e,label,tex,[('supplement',pg,label)],steps,author_pages=[('supplement',pg)],author_math=[tex]+[st[2] for st in steps if st[2]],lean=ln,issues=iss)
add('robustness-shapley-orders','经典Shapley等于多阶归因平均','Classical Shapley equals the average of order-wise attributions','supplement Eqs.(1),(4)',r'\phi(i)=\frac1n\sum_{m=0}^{n-1}\phi^{(m)}(i)',[('supplement',[1,4],'A;B.2')],[(r'按上下文大小m分组经典Shapley的有限和。每个大小m上下文权重$m!(n-1-m)!/n!=[n\binom{n-1}m]^{-1}$。',r'Group the classical Shapley sum by context size m. Each size-m context has weight $m!(n-1-m)!/n!=[n\binom{n-1}m]^{-1}$.',r'\frac{m!(n-1-m)!}{n!}=\frac1{n\binom{n-1}m}'),(r'大小m一组除以该组大小即原多阶归因，再对m乘1/n求和。不另将不同阶当作不同玩家。经典Shapley唯一性为Weber外引，本篇没有其完整本地证明。','Each group normalized by its cardinality is the source multi-order attribution. Summing the groups with weight 1/n proves the formula. Orders are not new players. Shapley uniqueness is attributed to Weber and has no local full proof here.','')])
add('robustness-shapley-efficiency','多阶归因的整体效率','Overall efficiency of order-wise attributions','B.2 property(4)',r'\frac1n\sum_{i\in N}\sum_{m=0}^{n-1}\phi^{(m)}(i)=g(N)-g(\varnothing)',[('formal',[8],'Eq.(5)'),('supplement',[5],'B.2')],[(r'为每个排列π写前缀链∅→{π1}→…→N，沿链的边际贡献望远镜相消，和恒为g(N)−b。','For each permutation write its prefix chain from ∅ to N. Marginal contributions telescope along the chain, giving g(N)−b for every permutation.',''),(r'对所有排列均匀平均。固定玩家i与大小m的上下文S，有m!(n−1−m)!个排列在i之前恰为S，因此平均i贡献是经典Shapley值。再用阶数分组公式即得原效率等式。','Average uniformly over all permutations. A fixed player i with predecessor set S of size m occurs in exactly m!(n−1−m)! permutations. Its average contribution is the classical Shapley value; apply the order decomposition to obtain the source equality.',r'\sum_i\phi(i)=g(N)-b')],author_pages=[('supplement',[5])],author_math=[r'g(N)-g(\varnothing)=\sum_{i\in N}\phi(i)=\frac1n\sum_{i\in N}\sum_{m=0}^{n-1}\phi^{(m)}(i)'])
add('robustness-marginal-attribution','相邻阶归因差等于平均pair交互','Adjacent attribution orders differ by average pair interaction','B.3 property(1)',r'\phi^{(m+1)}(i)-\phi^{(m)}(i)=\frac1{n-1}\sum_{j\ne i}I_{ij}^{(m)}',[('supplement',[5],'B.3')],[(r'令R=N\{i}，r=n−1。均匀选择大小m的S，再均匀选j∈R\S；每个大小m+1的U有m+1种前驱(U\{j},j)，因此扩张后的U均匀。',r'Let R=N\{i} and r=n−1. Choose a size-m S uniformly, then j uniformly in R\S. Every size-(m+1) U has m+1 predecessor pairs (U\{j},j), so the expanded context U is uniform.',r'\binom rm(r-m)=\binom r{m+1}(m+1)'),(r'将前一边际与后一边际相减：g(Sij)−g(Sj)−g(Si)+g(S)=Δg。两阶段样本(S,j)均匀于$r\binom{r-1}m$个合法标记上下文，因此可改成先均匀选j、再均匀选排除i,j的S。',r'Subtract the two marginal contributions to obtain the four-term Δg. The pairs (S,j) are uniform on $r\binom{r-1}m$ admissible marked contexts, so sampling can be reordered as choosing j first, then a context excluding i,j.',r'\binom rm(r-m)=r\binom{r-1}m'),(r'内平均按定义就是Iij^(m)，外平均除以n−1。m≤n−2确保所需上下文和缺失变量非空，不能把界外空平均当作原期望。','The inner average is Iij^(m), and the outer average divides by n−1. The bound m≤n−2 makes both sampling stages nonempty; out-of-range empty averages are not the source expectations.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[5])],author_math=[r'\phi^{(m+1)}(i)-\phi^{(m)}(i)=E_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},|S|=m}E_{j\in N\setminus(S\cup\{i\})}[g(Sij)-g(Sj)-g(Si)+g(S)]',r'=E_jE_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\},|S|=m}\Delta g(i,j,S)=E_j I_{ij}^{(m)}'])
add('robustness-accumulation','多阶归因积累性质','Accumulation of order-wise attribution','B.3 property(2)',r'\phi^{(m)}(i)=\phi^{(0)}(i)+E_{j\ne i}\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}I_{ij}^{(k)}',[('formal',[8],'Eq.(5)'),('supplement',[5],'B.3')],[(r'写$\phi^m-\phi^0$为相邻阶差的和，内部项逐项消去，端点m=0是空和。',r'Write $\phi^m-\phi^0$ as the sum of adjacent order differences. Interior terms telescope; m=0 is the empty sum.',r'\phi^{(m)}-\phi^{(0)}=\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}(\phi^{(k+1)}-\phi^{(k)})',['Harsanyi.Robustness.accumulation_telescope']),(r'在每个合法k调用上一边际关系，然后有限求和与均匀j平均交换，即得原表达式。','Apply the adjacent-order relation at every admissible k, then exchange the finite sum with the uniform j average. This gives the stated expression.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[5])],author_math=[r'\phi^{(m)}=\phi^{(m)}-\phi^{(m-1)}+\phi^{(m-1)}-\cdots-\phi^{(0)}+\phi^{(0)}',r'=E_jI_{ij}^{(m-1)}+E_jI_{ij}^{(m-2)}+\cdots+E_jI_{ij}^{(0)}+\phi^{(0)}=E_j\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}I_{ij}^{(k)}+\phi^{(0)}'],lean=['Harsanyi.Robustness.accumulation_telescope'])
add('robustness-interaction-efficiency','pair多阶交互重构输出','Output reconstruction by order-wise pair interactions','B.1 property(5)',r'g(N)=b+\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{n-2}\frac{n-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij}^{(m)}',[('formal',[5],'3 efficiency'),('supplement',[3,4],'B.1'),('supplement',[8],'F Eq.(9)')],[(r'从多阶归因效率$g(N)-b=n^{-1}\sum_i\sum_{m=0}^{n-1}\phi^{(m)}(i)$开始，对m>0代入累积公式，零阶项共出现n次。','Start from order-wise attribution efficiency. Insert the accumulation formula for m>0; the zeroth-order term appears exactly n times.',''),(r'固定交互阶k，累积求和中它出现在m=k+1,…,n−1，共n−1−k次。交换有限双重和并合并1/n和1/(n−1)两归一化因子。','A fixed interaction order k appears in m=k+1,…,n−1, exactly n−1−k times. Exchange finite sums and combine the two normalizations 1/n and 1/(n−1).',r'\sum_{m=1}^{n-1}\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}I_{ij}^{(k)}=\sum_{k=0}^{n-2}(n-1-k)I_{ij}^{(k)}'),(r'最后补回原始输出基线b；一般b不能删除。φ0(i)=g({i})−b，本式对任意实值有限游戏成立。','Restore the raw output baseline b, which cannot generally be omitted. Since φ0(i)=g({i})−b, the expression applies to any real-valued finite game.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[3,4])],author_math=[r'g(N)=g(\varnothing)+\frac1n\sum_i\sum_{m=0}^{n-1}\phi^{(m)}(i)',r'=g(\varnothing)+\frac1n\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\frac1n\sum_i\sum_{m=1}^{n-1}[E_j\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}I_{ij}^{(k)}+\phi^{(0)}(i)]',r'=g(\varnothing)+\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\frac1{n(n-1)}\sum_i\sum_{j\ne i}\sum_{m=1}^{n-1}\sum_{k=0}^{m-1}I_{ij}^{(k)}',r'=g(\varnothing)+\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_i\sum_{j\ne i}\sum_{m=0}^{n-2}\frac{n-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij}^{(m)}'])
add('robustness-attacking-decomposition','攻击效用的完整差分分解','Exact decomposition of attacking utility','formal Eq.(3)',r'\Delta g(N)=\Delta b+\sum_i\Delta\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_{i\ne j,m}\Delta J_{ij}^{(m)}',[('formal',[5],'Eq.(3)')],[(r'对正常输入x与对抗输入xadv分别应用交互效率，再逐项相减。J的阶数权重只依赖n,m，所以差可移入交互。','Apply interaction efficiency separately to the normal and adversarial inputs and subtract termwise. The J weight depends only on n,m, so the difference enters the interaction.',r'J_{ij}^{(m)}=\frac{n-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij}^{(m)}'),(r'若两输入使用同一固定输入基线向量r，全mask输入都为r，所以Δb=0。单点差可小是经验解释，不从有限游戏恒等式推出；重写保留该项。','If both inputs use the same fixed input baseline r, their fully masked inputs equal r and Δb=0. Small singleton changes are empirical, not a consequence of the finite-game identity, and the rewritten equality retains them.','')])
add('robustness-entropy-interaction','Proposition1：+条件熵交互等于co-information','Proposition 1: positive conditional-entropy interaction equals co-information','Proposition1; supplement Eq.(6)',r'I_{ij}^{(m)}=E_{S,|S|=m}MI(X_i;X_j;Y\mid X_S)',[('formal',[7],'4.1 Proposition1'),('supplement',[6],'B.4 Eq.(6)')],[(r'此条g是数据总体的条件熵集合函数，不是单输入log分类分数。沿用原g(S)=H(Y|XS)的正号；设h0=H(Y|XS)、hi=H(Y|XS,Xi)、hj=H(Y|XS,Xj)、hij=H(Y|XS,Xi,Xj)。','Here g is the population conditional-entropy game, distinct from a single-input log classification score. Retain the source positive sign g(S)=H(Y|XS), and denote its four conditioned entropies by h0, hi, hj and hij.',''),(r'四项差严格为hij−hi−hj+h0=(h0−hi)−(hj−hij)=MI(Xi;Y|XS)−MI(Xi;Y|XS,Xj)。这与原Eq7使用的co-information符号一致；修复原证明先整体取负的错误。','The four-term difference is exactly hij−hi−hj+h0=(h0−hi)−(hj−hij), which is MI(Xi;Y|XS)−MI(Xi;Y|XS,Xj). This matches the co-information convention used in Equation (7), repairing the source proof’s overall negation.',r'\Delta g=MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S)-MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S,X_j)',['Harsanyi.Entropy.co_information_identity']),(r'对合法上下文取均匀平均即得原目标。若以每个mask输入的网络概率替代条件概率，必须另核对它们是否来自同一个联合分布；此适配条件不由代数恒等式自动验证。','Average uniformly over admissible contexts to obtain the source claim. Replacing conditional probabilities by the network output on each masked input requires a separate check that they belong to one coherent joint law; the algebraic identity does not certify that adapter.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[6])],author_math=[r'I_{ij}^{(m)}=E_S[g(Sij)-g(Si)-g(Sj)+g(S)]',r'=E_S[-H(Y\mid X_S,X_i,X_j)+H(Y\mid X_S,X_i)+H(Y\mid X_S,X_j)-H(H\mid X_S)]',r'=E_S[H(Y\mid X_S,X_j)-H(Y\mid X_S,X_j,X_i)+H(Y\mid X_S,X_i)-H(Y\mid X_S)]',r'=E_S[MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S,X_j)-MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S)]=E_S MI(X_i;X_j;Y\mid X_S)'],issues=[i1],lean=['Harsanyi.Entropy.co_information_identity'])
add('robustness-exclusive-shared-benefits','联合MI的独享与共享分解','Exclusive and shared components of joint mutual information','supplement Eq.(7)',r'MI(X_{\{i,j\}};Y\mid X_S)=MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S,X_j)+MI(X_j;Y\mid X_S,X_i)+MI(X_i;X_j;Y\mid X_S)',[('supplement',[6,7],'B.4 Eq.(7)')],[(r'按co-information定义，共享项是(h0−hi)−(hj−hij)；两个独享项分别为hj−hij和hi−hij。三项相加所有中间熵抵消，仅剩h0−hij，即联合MI。','By the co-information definition, the shared term is (h0−hi)−(hj−hij), and the exclusive terms are hj−hij and hi−hij. Adding cancels the intermediate entropies and leaves h0−hij, the joint information.',r'h_0-h_{ij}=(h_j-h_{ij})+(h_i-h_{ij})+(h_{ij}-h_i-h_j+h_0)',['Harsanyi.Entropy.exclusive_shared_identity']),(r'原作者对数证明可在正联合质量项展开条件概率。零概率项不取不存在的条件对数；用熵差路线同时覆盖这些项。不保证共享co-information非负。','The source logarithmic proof expands conditional probabilities on positive joint-mass terms. Zero terms do not require undefined conditional logarithms, and the entropy-difference route covers them. Shared co-information need not be nonnegative.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[7])],author_math=[r'R=MI(X_i;Y\mid X_j,X_S)+MI(X_j;Y\mid X_i,X_S)+MI(X_i;X_j;Y\mid X_S)',r'=MI(X_i;Y\mid X_j,X_S)+MI(X_j;Y\mid X_i,X_S)+MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S)-MI(X_i;Y\mid X_j,X_S)',r'=MI(X_i;Y\mid X_j,X_S)+MI(X_i;Y\mid X_S)',r'=\sum_{x_i,x_j,x_S,y}p(x_i,x_j,x_S,y)\log\frac{p(x_j,y\mid x_i,x_S)p(x_i,y\mid x_S)}{p(x_j\mid x_i,x_S)p(y\mid x_i,x_S)p(x_i\mid x_S)p(y\mid x_S)}',r'=\sum p(x_i,x_j,x_S,y)\log\frac{p(x_i,x_j,x_S,y)}{p(x_j\mid x_i,x_S)p(x_i\mid x_S)p(y\mid x_S)p(x_S)}',r'=\sum p(x_i,x_j,x_S,y)\log\frac{p(x_i,x_j,y\mid x_S)}{p(x_i,x_j\mid x_S)p(y\mid x_S)}=MI(X_{\{i,j\}};Y\mid X_S)'],lean=['Harsanyi.Entropy.exclusive_shared_identity'])
add('robustness-delta-average','正常与攻击交互差的平均','Averaging normal-versus-adversarial interaction differences','supplement Eq.(8)',r'\Delta I^{(m)}=E_{x\in\Omega}E_{i,j}\left[I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)-I_{ij}^{(m)}(x_{adv})\right]',[('supplement',[7,8],'D')],[(r'原样本与对应攻击样本按x→xadv成对，攻击数据集的平均用同一原样本权重推前；不能改用独立采样的不同权重总体。','Pair each original sample with its attack and push forward the same sample weights to the attack set. Independently sampled populations with different weights would not justify the equality.',''),(r'在该配对下两平均相减等于平均差，pair平均同样有限线性；逐项识别ΔIij得原式。','Under this pairing, subtracting the two averages equals averaging their difference. The pair average is also linear; identify each ΔIij term to obtain the expression.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.average_sub'])],author_pages=[('supplement',[8])],author_math=[r'\Delta I^{(m)}=E_{x\in\Omega_{nor}}E_{i,j}I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)-E_{x\in\Omega_{adv}}E_{i,j}I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)',r'=E_{x\in\Omega_{nor}}E_{i,j}I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)-E_{x\in\Omega_{nor}}E_{i,j}I_{ij}^{(m)}(x+\Delta x)',r'=E_{x\in\Omega_{nor}}E_{i,j}[I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)-I_{ij}^{(m)}(x_{adv})]=E_xE_{i,j}\Delta I_{ij}^{(m)}(x)'],lean=['Harsanyi.Robustness.average_sub'])
add('robustness-disentanglement','disentanglement比值及同号意义','Disentanglement ratio and its same-sign interpretation','formal Eq.(4); supplement Eq.(10)',r'D^{(m)}=E_xE_{i\ne j}\frac{|E_S\Delta g(i,j,S)|}{E_S|\Delta g(i,j,S)|}',[('formal',[8],'4.2'),('supplement',[8],'F')],[(r'对一个pair和样本，在分母正的定义域，三角不等式$|\sum a_S|\le\sum|a_S|$给比值在[0,1]。正规有限平均因子正且上下文族非空。分母0的原式另列未定义。','For one sample and pair with positive denominator, the triangle inequality bounds the ratio between zero and one. The finite uniform normalization is positive and the context family is nonempty. The zero-denominator source expression is separately flagged.',''),(r'若所有上下文项严格正，则绝对平均等于平均绝对，ratio=1；全严格负同理。恰好正负平衡的平均为0可给ratio=0。全局D还平均其他pair，单一pair同号不自动使全局D=1。','If every context term is strictly positive, the absolute average equals the average absolute value, giving ratio one; all-negative terms work similarly. A balanced nonzero mixture gives ratio zero. A same-sign single pair does not force the global D to one because other pairs are also averaged.','')],issues=[i4],role='scope_analysis',assessment='domain_issue')
add('robustness-detector-attribution','检测归因等于最高阶边际','Detector attribution equals the highest-order marginal','supplement Eq.(11); G proof',[r'\phi(x)_i=f(x)_c-f(x^{(i)})_c=\phi^{(n-1)}(i\mid x)'][0],[('formal',[8],'4.3'),('supplement',[9],'G')],[(r'固定原输入选出的类别c=argmax f(x)，原检测mask把i坐标置0，故使用同一零输入基线的类别输出游戏g。类别在两次输出中固定，不能重新选mask后的类别。','Fix the category c selected on the original input. The detector masks coordinate i to zero, so use the category-output game with the same zero input baseline. The category remains fixed and is not reselected after masking.',''),(r'排除i而大小n−1的上下文只有N\{i}一个，均匀平均即g(N)−g(N\{i})。原输出基线b无需为0，因取差抵消。',r'The only context excluding i with size n−1 is N\{i}. Its average is g(N)−g(N\{i}). No zero output baseline is required, because it cancels in the difference.','',['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_top'])],author_pages=[('supplement',[9])],author_math=[r'g(N)-g(N\setminus\{i\})=g((N\setminus\{i\})\cup\{i\})-g(N\setminus\{i\})',r'=g(S\cup\{i\})-g(S)=E_{S\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},|S|=n-1}[g(S\cup\{i\})-g(S)]=\phi^{(n-1)}(i)'],lean=['Harsanyi.Robustness.attribution_top'])
add('robustness-dropout-expansion','固定大小dropout的原取整公式错误','The rounded fixed-size dropout formula is false','supplement H Eqs.(12)–(15)',r'E_{|K|=k}g(K)=b+(1-\alpha)\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}\frac{k-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij}^{(m)},\quad k=\lfloor(1-\alpha)n\rfloor',[('formal',[9,10],'4.3 cutout'),('supplement',[9,10],'H')],[(r'保留原floor与原1−α。原模型均匀选择固定k子集；每个变量的包含率是k/n。取n=4,α=2/5,k=2，g(S)=|S|时所有pair四项差0、b=0、φ0=1。','Retain the source floor and 1−α coefficient. Uniform fixed-size sampling includes each variable with probability k/n. Set n=4, α=2/5, k=2 and g(S)=|S|, so b=0, every zeroth attribution is one, and every pair difference is zero.',''),(r'真实平均g(K)=2，原式右边12/5。这个反例直接否定原Eq14取整子句，不把k/n替换回去再冒充原目标被证。','The actual average is two, while the source right side is 12/5. This directly refutes the rounded-rate clause in Equation (14); replacing the coefficient by k/n would change the target.',r'2\ne\frac{12}5'),(r'合法的有限计数还说明原高阶截断机制：固定(i,j,S)的大小m+2集合被K包含的计数是binom(n−m−2,k−m−2)。对m≤k−2重排两阶段均匀平均可得相应全N交互权重；m>k−2无上下文。该机制并不提供所有样本鲁棒性保证。','Finite counting still explains the truncation mechanism: a fixed (i,j,S) set of size m+2 is contained in exactly binom(n−m−2,k−m−2) retained sets. For m≤k−2, reordering uniform averages gives the corresponding full-universe interaction weights; larger orders have no contexts. This mechanism does not guarantee robustness of every sample.','')],author_pages=[('supplement',[9,10])],author_math=[r'g(N)=b+\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{n-2}\frac{n-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij,N}^{(m)}',r'g(K)=b+\sum_{i\in K}\phi^{(0)}(i\mid K)+\sum_{i\ne j\in K}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}\frac{k-1-m}{k(k-1)}I_{ij,K}^{(m)}',r'E_Kg(K)=b+E_K\sum_{i\in K}(g(i)-b)+E_K\sum_{i\ne j\in K}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}\frac{k-1-m}{k(k-1)}I_{ij,K}^{(m)}',r'=b+(1-\alpha)\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\frac{k(k-1)}{n(n-1)}\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}\frac{k-1-m}{k(k-1)}E_K E_{S\subseteq K\setminus\{i,j\},|S|=m}\Delta g',r'=b+(1-\alpha)\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}\frac{k-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij,N}^{(m)}',r'g(N)-g^\alpha(N)=\alpha\sum_i\phi^{(0)}(i)+\frac\alpha{n-1}\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=0}^{k-2}I_{ij,N}^{(m)}+\sum_{i\ne j}\sum_{m=k-1}^{n-2}\frac{n-1-m}{n(n-1)}I_{ij,N}^{(m)}'],issues=[i3],role='counterexample',assessment='false_original_floor_clause')
add('robustness-inference-heuristics','敏感性、熵趋势与防御的解释范围','Scope of sensitivity, entropy-trend and defense interpretations','Sections4.1–4.3; supplement E,I',[r'\text{Empirical and heuristic conclusions are distinct from the finite identities.}'][0],[('formal',[1,2,3,4,6,7,8,9,10],'main empirical/explanation scope'),('supplement',[1,7,8,10,11,12,13,14,15,16],'A,C,E,I;References')],[(r'原“更大条件上下文因此必更敏感”不是由Proposition1熵代数推出的扰动不等式；模型可为常数或纯低阶函数。检测有效性、恢复性、rank/cutout优势、训练类别特征是原具体实验/启发解释。','The inference that a larger conditioned context must be more perturbation-sensitive does not follow from Proposition 1’s entropy algebra; a model may be constant or purely low order. Detector performance, recoverability, rank/cutout advantages and learned category features are specific experiments or heuristic interpretations.',''),(r'原log正确标签概率与熵的负趋势仅roughly：多类别概率可改变非目标类别分配而不保持熵单调。Shapley唯一性、interaction index与认证鲁棒性等外引没有本篇本地证明；完整保留分类与定位。','The negative trend between the correct-label log probability and entropy is explicitly approximate: changing the distribution among other classes can change entropy without preserving monotonicity. Shapley uniqueness, the interaction index and certified robustness are external results without local proofs here; their source classification and locations are retained.','')],kind='derived_claim_scope',role='scope_analysis',assessment='empirical_or_unquantified')
